  "payload": {
    "approximation_regime": "ASYMPTOTIC; The mean identities are asserted exact. The included asymptotic corollary has additive remainder e^(-beta)2^(n-nu)(4^nu-1)o(1), without an explicit constant; the record is marked ASYMPTOTIC to retain that corollary's weaker strength.",
    "assumptions": [
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:compressible-mean-0",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:57a8f7b48cbbd922fd6a233504ef93fc33113a60111ae2416d1c56f0603e7662",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-span-411-429",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:11da1ac1f79b57386dbdb5951fad982b961fb7abed6bf07d1da10dd3db223454",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-span-984-1011",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:e67da0c007afad22edacb33c45b362c9424f8babd6e6783413bb2d8b203d8123",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-span-1024-1039",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "States are prepared from |0>^tensor n using a nu-qubit Haar unitary followed by a uniformly sampled n-qubit Clifford."
      },
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:compressible-mean-1",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:57a8f7b48cbbd922fd6a233504ef93fc33113a60111ae2416d1c56f0603e7662",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-span-411-429",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:11da1ac1f79b57386dbdb5951fad982b961fb7abed6bf07d1da10dd3db223454",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-span-984-1011",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:e67da0c007afad22edacb33c45b362c9424f8babd6e6783413bb2d8b203d8123",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-span-1024-1039",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "The sampling measure is mu_(n,nu)=mu_Cl_n * mu_Haar_nu."
      },
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:compressible-mean-2",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:57a8f7b48cbbd922fd6a233504ef93fc33113a60111ae2416d1c56f0603e7662",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-span-411-429",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:11da1ac1f79b57386dbdb5951fad982b961fb7abed6bf07d1da10dd3db223454",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-span-984-1011",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:e67da0c007afad22edacb33c45b362c9424f8babd6e6783413bb2d8b203d8123",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-span-1024-1039",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "The asymptotic statement assumes fixed beta and large 2^nu, or beta^2=o(2^nu)."
      },
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:compressible-mean-3",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
